  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given boolen expression are<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\sim p \\vee q \\equiv p \\rightarrow q \\text { and } \\sim q \\wedge p \\equiv \\sim(p \\rightarrow q) \\\\<br />& \\text { Negation of } \\sim(p \\rightarrow q) \\rightarrow(p \\rightarrow q) \\\\<br />& \\text { is } \\sim(p \\rightarrow q) \\wedge(\\sim(p \\rightarrow q)) \\text { i.e., } \\sim(p \\rightarrow q)<br />\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
